flowchart TB
    LIVE[Live inspector] --> CMD[Explicit pause/resume/step/cancel request]
    CMD --> OWNER[Harness command admission and durable result]
    OWNER -->|Accepted only| WAIT[Pending display]
    OWNER -->|Applied receipt| CURRENT[Refresh authoritative state]
    CMD -->|Lost response| LOOKUP[Lookup same command ID]
    LOOKUP --> OWNER
    HISTORY[Historical inspector] --> READ[Read retained snapshots and events]
    READ --> OFFLINE[Owner offline replay if admitted]
    OFFLINE --> ZERO[Zero game and provider calls]
    DRAFT[Fork historical definition into draft] --> NEW[Separate explicit publish and start]
